rk_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027","text":"愈厲激揚三軍遵自外横擊大破之斬首萬餘級赴水死者殆盡道覆單舸走還盆口初使遵為游軍衆咸云今彊敵在前唯患衆少不應割削見力置無用之地及破道覆果得游軍之力衆乃服焉遵字慧明臨淮海西人道規從母兄蕭氏舅也官至右將軍宣城內史淮南太守義熙十年卒追贈撫軍將軍追封監利縣侯食邑七百戶道規進號征西大將軍開府儀同三司加散騎常侍固辭俄而寢疾改授都督豫章江二州揚州之宣城淮南廬江歷陽安豐堂邑六郡諸軍事豫州刺史持節常侍將軍如故以疾不拜八年閏月薨于京師時年","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"遵","kind":"person","person_id":"046_8et_2s0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"道覆","kind":"person","person_id":"bt2_eqz_i4y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"遵","kind":"person","person_id":"046_8et_2s0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"道覆","kind":"person","person_id":"bt2_eqz_i4y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"遵","kind":"person","person_id":"046_8et_2s0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"慧明","kind":"person","person_id":"046_8et_2s0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"道規","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p027:m0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"道規","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/song051-wyd1739-zongshi/transcription-projection.json","raw_file_sha256":"8d2ae0cd97228ef9a252a07a5886f2f0c3d445e305f311e484b38a97f462fcad","unit_key":"unit027","source_layer":"received_chapter","first_line":257,"last_line":266},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","book_id":"b-songshu-051","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014","text":"鎮之初為琅邪王衞軍行參軍，出補剡、上虞令，並有能名。內史謝輶請為山陰令，復有殊績。遷衞軍參軍，本國郎中令，加寧朔將軍。桓玄輔晉，以為大將軍錄事參軍。時三吳飢荒，遣鎮之銜命賑卹，而會稽內史王愉不奉符旨，鎮之依事糾奏。愉子綏，玄之外甥，當時貴盛，鎮之為所排抑，以母老求補安成太守。及玄敗，玄將苻宏寇亂郡境，鎮之拒戰彌年，子弟五人，並臨陣見殺。母憂去職，在官清潔，妻子無以自給，乃棄家致喪還上虞舊墓。葬畢，為子標之求安復令，隨子之官。服闋，為征西道規司馬、南平太守。徐道覆逼江陵，加鎮之建威將軍，統檀道濟、到彥之等討道覆，以不經將帥，固辭，不見聽。既而前軍失利，白衣領職，尋復本官。以討道覆功，封華容縣五等男，徵廷尉。晉穆帝何皇后山陵，領將作大匠。遷御史中丞，秉正不撓，百僚憚之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"琅邪王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"待核首次府主身份"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"謝輶","kind":"person","person_id":"ao0_c0z_ryc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"桓玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"王愉","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"愉","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"s